WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.600
The Mixer, F9, has a strip for each track: level, pan, mute and solo.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.800
Drag a fader to set the level. The chords go down a little.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:20.600
The knob above it pans the sound left or right.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.200
The green switch mutes a track. Click it again to bring it back.

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:32.600
S solos a track: you hear only it. Click it again to hear everything.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:38.600
Watch the Master meter: keep the loudest peaks out of the red.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:44.400
Set the levels first, then the effects. Small moves go a long way.
